                           DD-ConfTop V1.0 by Hydra
                           ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~

Features
~~~~~~~~
DDConfTop as a conference top uploaders for DayDream BBS. It has following
features:

o Generates alltime top uploaders of a conference

o Generates last week top uploaders of a conference

o Generates current week top uploaders of a conference

o Configurable outlook

o Able to enter message when the week has changed

o Configurable amount of listed users


Requirements
~~~~~~~~~~~~
This door requires DayDream BBS V1.18+. 

This is *NOT* residentable.

Usage
~~~~~

Conftop usage is like this:

Conftop [node] [mode].

Naturally, node should be always %N. Mode can be:

	all  - do the list of top alltime uploaders of the conference
        last - do the list of top uploaders (last week) of the conf
        this - do the list of top uploaders (this week) of the conf

If no mode is specified, Conftop runs in "add data" mode (Examine.DAT only).

*NOTE*. Conftop MUST be run as Daydream door!!


Installation
~~~~~~~~~~~~
1) Copy Conftop executable to C:

2) Add Doors:Conftop %N line to Examine.DAT of every conference you wish
   to use this conftop door.

3) Copy DD-ConfTop.CFG to the directory where you have your config-files.

4) Make bulletins containing ÿDdoors:conftop %N all|| etc to Bulletins/
   directory (all three (all/last/this)).

5) Edit MSGCOM[CONF] lines in Conftop configfile

Config
~~~~~~
DD-ConfTop.CFG may contain following keywords:

NOOPERETOR

	- No operator logins.

HEADER "    "

	- Custom header, may have multiple lines inside ":s.

LINE "    "

	- Custom design for entries

TAIL "    "

	- Custom design for tail

MAXLINES [number]

	- Maximum number of entries, default 15.

MSGCOM[conf] '      '

	- This is a bit more tricky. There should be MSGCOM-entry line for
	  every conference you want to make message weekly. Inside ':s is
	  a robowriter command line (make sure robowriter is in path).

	  example:

MSGCOM31 'robowriter CONF 31 base 1 msg %s from ConfTop to All Subject "Uploaders last week in this conf"'

	  Would post message message to all users to conference 31 weekly
	  about to uploaders in conf 31.

